{
  // tests/harness/ — the crossing harness (tests/host_surface.rs's
  // probe), its own module dir like every rut program. Dep-free on
  // purpose: the only `use` names `web`, and `web` is the HOST DECL
  // surface — the embedder registers it in both lanes (src/mount.rs), so
  // it rides no manifest path here, the same shape the rut/ packages
  // ride. The DECLARATION is still structural, not absent: the walk
  // lane stamps the presence-only `web` row onto this pkg's parsed
  // manifest (src/mount.rs `declare_web`) — a rut.jsonc text cannot
  // spell it while the pathless-descriptor grammar stays deferred.
  "name": "harness"}
